    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3951" root="تعب" body-key="t">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعِبٌ</span></b>  <i>Fatigued, tired, wearied,</i> or <i>jaded;</i> as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتْعَبٌ</span></b> ; (S, Msb, K;) but not <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَتْعُوبٌ</span>. (S,
K.) [↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْبَان</span></b> , for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْبَانٌ</span>, fem. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>, is used
in this sense in the present day.]

